---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
import Icon from "../components/Icon.astro";
---

<MainLayout
  title="What company verification means"
  description="Understand the Salam Sourcing company verification check, the document review process and what to consider when choosing a business partner."
>
  <section class="container reading section verification-explainer">
    <div class="verification-symbol"><Icon name="shield" size={38} /></div><p
      class="eyebrow"
    >
      Know who you’re working with
    </p><h1>What does a verified company mean?</h1>
    <p class="lead mt-5">
      The verification check means Salam Sourcing has reviewed the company’s
      submitted business identity documents and approved its verification.
    </p>
    <div class="stack mt-8">
      <article class="card">
        <h2>Business identity, reviewed</h2><p>
          Companies submit business documents for review. Approval is separate
          from reviewing and publishing individual product or service listings.
        </p>
      </article><article class="card">
        <h2>Look for the check on company profiles</h2><p>
          Hover over or tap the check to see what it means. A company’s
          verification can change or require a new review when its business
          identity changes.
        </p>
      </article><article class="card">
        <h2>Make an informed trade decision</h2><p>
          Verification doesn’t guarantee product quality, delivery, payment or
          the outcome of a transaction. Review specifications, discuss terms and
          complete any checks your business needs before agreeing to trade.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
    <div class="actions mt-8">
      <a class="button" href="/">Browse the marketplace</a><a
        class="text-link"
        href="/help">Ask about verification</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>
